Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:41:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Add add10/add25/add40 to fill a raid with addclass bots

Tops the master's group up to a 10, 25 or 40-man raid with a tank/healer/damage
mix (2/3/5, 3/6/16, 4/10/26), counting the roles already in the group. Classes
come from fixed rotations that spread raid buffs, and each bot gets its role's
premade spec and matching gear once it logs in. The addclass character picker
moves into PickAddclassCharacter() so both commands share it.
